    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game places players in a mysterious black background, with a white sphere serving as the primary control object. Use the ASDW keys to navigate the white sphere, allowing it to freely move across the screen. The objective is to dodge the colorful blocks coming from all directions and use the left mouse button to launch attacks, eliminating these threats. Each colored block represents a different challenge, requiring players to employ flexible strategies, both to avoid attacks and to find opportunities to counterattack. If the player is hit by a colored block, a life is lost. Players have three lives in total, and once these chances are exhausted, the game ends. The game's visuals are simple yet aesthetically pleasing, with a stark contrast between black and white, enhanced by carefully designed sound effects that make each collision and attack come alive. This is a game that tests players' reflexes and strategic thinking, suitable for anyone looking for a challenge.</p>",
